    "title": "Inmate dies at Southern State Correctional Facility in Springfield - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Daniel Duric ,\n1 hours ago SPRINGFIELD, VT — The Vermont State Police is investigating the death of an inmate in the custody of Southern State Correctional Facility. Police were notified at 1:15 p.m. on Dec. 24 that Robert Labonte, 60, of Enosburgh, was sent to Springfield Hospital Emergency Department and was pronounced deceased by the medical staff upon arrival. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
